Backport merge limits from v5.4.1 (CVE-2026-84375 / GHSA-2883-xcg3-v3hh)

Fixes maxTotalMergeKeys not counting empty merge-source mappings, allowing a
crafted YAML document to trigger a CWE-400 uncontrolled resource consumption
(DoS) via sequences of empty merge-source mappings and abnormally large merge
sequences. Each merge source mapping is now charged against the merge budget,
and an upper bound is enforced on merge sequence size.

